          "say": "Also, x to the 5 over x to the 5 is x to the 0. And it's 1.",
          "write": "x⁵ ÷ x⁵ = x⁰ = 1"
        },
        {
          "say": "Any number except zero, to the power zero, is 1.",
          "write": "a⁰ = 1"
        },
        {
          "say": "So 4 times 7 to the 0, plus 3 to the 0, is 5.",
          "write": "4 × 1 + 1 = 5"
        }
      ]
